{
  "_comment": "Copy to config/local/grvt_maker.json (git-ignored). Shadow needs no keys; live needs live_enabled true, --live and the secrets file (chmod 600); deploy/live/grvt-maker/start.sh does all of it. Second canary on a 200 USDT account: ADA at +/-2 bps and PUMP at +/-1 bps, the two symbols still positive after the replay's queue fix; 250 USDT orders, at most 250 USDT per symbol, loss 5/10 USDT per symbol and day.",
